#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:5 608e263d01284145a642b526cc451c77
msgid "Autotest Tests"
msgstr "Autotest 测试"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:7 bed47858402f4c7ca0d8772beb27f387
msgid ""
"The autotest suite is constantly evolving.  There are a lot of predefined "
"convenience functions available (see `Vehicle tests "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/vehicle_test_suite.py>`__"
" .  There are also many convenience functions within individual vehicle test"
" suites like the `Plane tests "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/arduplane.py>`__)."
"  These functions can make writing tests fast, and there are a lot of things"
" your test can assume when it starts and stops"
msgstr ""
"autotest 测试套件在不断演进。有大量预定义的便捷函数可用（见 `Vehicle tests "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/vehicle_test_suite.py>`__。各机型的测试套件内部也有许多便捷函数，例如"
" `Plane tests "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/arduplane.py>`__）。这些函数可以让编写测试变得很快，而且你的测试在开始和结束时可以做出很多假设"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:9 57dcd9d049fd462c8324aa6fc577a60d
msgid ""
"This document outlines some of the assumptions you can make and some of the "
"utilities you can take advantage of."
msgstr "本文档介绍了你可以做出的一些假设，以及你可以利用的一些工具函数。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:12 62026bb0919e4da0a84ac500b90a8a6d
msgid "Assumptions Your test Can Make"
msgstr "你的测试可以做出的假设"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:15 731458e128f2443a99a04f85c69e29e8
msgid "Location"
msgstr "存放位置"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:16 0711a2dc4361482aae61848285de5686
msgid ""
"For the Copter test suite you can assume the vehicle starts and the same "
"location each time."
msgstr "对于 Copter 测试套件，你可以假设机体每次都从相同位置启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:18 530a8e7dd1c74ffbb5de7575b54fcff6
msgid "Plane starts roughly in the CMAC location."
msgstr "Plane 大致从 CMAC 位置启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:20 479a960529bf433d9a3bb6a4a30c714c
msgid "QuadPlane always starts in the same location in Dalby."
msgstr "QuadPlane 总是从 Dalby 的同一位置启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:22 3a56668d285c4b6bafb5831fb565a0c8
msgid "All other tests do not guarantee a starting location or rotation."
msgstr "所有其他测试不保证起始位置或朝向。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:25 83b6a82a1b8b49a58fb547031a1c2604
msgid "Disarmed"
msgstr "已上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:27 2fdee85c4f7946d2a7bf35d0f5c1adaa
msgid ""
"You can assume your vehicle starts disarmed (except for AntennaTracker, "
"which is always armed)."
msgstr "你可以假设机体启动时处于上锁状态（AntennaTracker 除外，它始终处于解锁状态）。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:30 6e63966b903745d89a4fdb8017364513
msgid "RC Inputs"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:32 e22cdff9985545238b444ee30d7fc80a
msgid "RC inputs are zeroed before your test starts"
msgstr "在你的测试开始前，RC 输入会被清零"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:35 1e5d5df8db0a40ab898c68885f1944c8
msgid "Contexts"
msgstr "上下文（Context）"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:37 a24b354af1fb4b2d9ba1eb82ca894e00
msgid ""
"Contexts allow test suite state changes to be rolled back conveniently."
msgstr "上下文（context）可以方便地回滚测试套件的状态变更。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:39 e4131d6b4dda45aea595476e398a84d5
msgid ""
"Each test gets an implicit context, and you can push any number of contexts "
"onto the stack.  You do not need to wrap your test in a context - you get "
"one for free from the harness."
msgstr "每个测试都有一个隐式的上下文，你还可以向栈中压入任意数量的上下文。你不需要把测试包在一个上下文里——测试框架会免费给你一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:41 7b847a76ba194e61ad8c40d26c2ea8a5
msgid ""
"When you pop a context, various state change are reverted to the way they "
"were before the context was pushed.  Notably:"
msgstr "当弹出一个上下文时，各种状态变更会恢复到该上下文被压入之前的样子。特别是："

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:43 2a64f703865f4818b439d15219684cad
msgid "parameters are reverted to their values before the context change"
msgstr "参数恢复为上下文变更之前的值"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:44 b8865fdecac54facbbdb7d5bf1026dca
msgid "message rates set via ``context_set_message_rate_hz`` are reverted"
msgstr "通过 ``context_set_message_rate_hz`` 设置的消息速率会被恢复"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:45 43d2cbb5b932446397cd1bf50c7e44ed
msgid ""
"filesystem files backed up with ``context_backup_file`` get their original "
"contents back"
msgstr "通过 ``context_backup_file`` 备份的文件系统文件会恢复其原始内容"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:46 59f98336b00a41d8b2b953616ea47c89
msgid ""
"Lua scripts installed with ``install_script_content_context`` are removed"
msgstr "通过 ``install_script_content_context`` 安装的 Lua 脚本会被移除"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:48 9d6f1fac7a684d819531119a6be23959
msgid ""
"Popping a context may involve rebooting the simulation.  We reboot SITL:"
msgstr "弹出上下文可能涉及重启仿真。以下情况我们会重启 SITL："

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:49 22b5eca4bb4f4629bb2250a5c76017eb
msgid ""
"if your test reboots the simulation (after resetting parameters to their "
"pre-test values, in case there are reboot-required parameters)"
msgstr "如果你的测试重启了仿真（会先把参数重置为测试前的值，以防存在需要重启才生效的参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:50 ed8197909f814a0eb41d587302abe080
msgid "if your test set the vehicle home via ``self.set_home(loc)``"
msgstr "如果你的测试通过 ``self.set_home(loc)`` 设置了机体家点"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:53 de5cf74424f347429773464b7524ad19
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:56 016ee6de7f0a4ddda4d3e125a9f71e04
msgid "self.reboot_sitl()"
msgstr "self.reboot_sitl()"

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:58 129b3b6753cd40d3969a36c02bf3fc39
msgid ""
"Reboots not just the vehicle but the entire simulation.  Useful for reboot-"
"required parameters."
msgstr "不仅重启机体，而且重启整个仿真。对需要重启才生效的参数很有用。"
